# Drives the mower to a pose through the mowing and navigation areas of the map (mowbite_logic): the MowBite Planner
# plans the way (~/plan_transit), mowbite_follower drives it. Only from IDLE, without emergency, with a good position
# and heading, a map that fits the datum and a safety measurement of the platform. The answer comes once the drive has
# started or was refused; how it ended is a DRIVE event.

# m and rad in the map frame, base_link
float64 x
float64 y
float64 heading
# true: arrive facing heading
bool use_heading
---
bool success
# why not, or the length of the way
string message
